# Workshop screenshots on Nelim's tribe (feature 17-publication-shots). The save Nelims-tribe.rws and the place steps ("Nelim's Sanctuary: ...") come from
# Nelim's Sanctuary Backlot (own repository, SanctuaryBacklot/); the generic steps ("Nelim's Pickle Tools: ...": filth,
# eclipse, all animals, frame the cell, screenshot mode, decor, colonist looks, hover) stay in Nelim's Pickle Tools. This mod keeps no copy of the save.
# Since 2026-10-29 this is the looks pass of SanctuaryBacklot (wsl-deps.sanctuary-looks.map, copied): scene 1 to 4 of the 1.2.0 shotlist need
# Roo's HD Hairstyles, Hat Hair Control, the facial animation stack with VEFA, the decor, colonist and coat steps. Seeds: config/sanctuary/
# (copied from SanctuaryBacklot/Tests/Pickle/config/sanctuary-looks/; the runner stages config/<pass name>/ with pass name = map suffix).
nelim.sanctuarybacklot path:SanctuaryBacklot/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode path:PickleTools/ScreenshotMode/Mod
nelim.pickletools.hoversteps path:PickleTools/HoverSteps/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio path:PickleTools/ScreenshotStudio/Mod
nelim.pickletools.camerazoom path:PickleTools/CameraZoom/Mod
nelim.pickletools.stagedecor path:PickleTools/StageDecor/Mod
nelim.pickletools.coatsteps path:PickleTools/CoatSteps/Mod
